# "Activate only if there are two or more creature cards in your graveyard" (CR 602.5b): your own graveyard only (Bot2's holds
# two creature cards the whole time), the creature cards counted, not the Looting or the land beside them. With one it is
# refused, with two (exactly the limit) it makes a tapped 2/1 black Villain token with menace for exactly {3}, tapping Zola.

